## Bugs Identified

### BUG-030 – Missing Approval Configuration for Production Receipt

**Module:** Production → Production Receipt

- While creating a Production Receipt under Business Unit **Helal & Brothers (Baburhat) [HBB]**, the system displayed the following error:

> "No active approval configuration for document type PRODUCTION_RECEIPT and Business Unit 'Helal & Brothers (Baburhat) [HBB]' (id=5). Configure it at Admin → Approval → Configurations."

- Production Receipt processing was blocked until the required approval configuration was added.
- After adding the approval configuration, the transaction was completed successfully.

**Priority:** Medium

**Remarks:** Root cause was identified as a missing approval configuration rather than an application code defect.

